* ICsprout55 RF MOS v0.2: UNCALIBRATED extrinsic 4T/5T/6T structures.
* Requires vendor model .lib tt_mos in the simulation deck; the 5T/6T
* triple-well flavours additionally require .lib tt_dio.
* wf is per-finger drawn width; vendor wrapper w expects TOTAL width.
* Default extrinsic R is tiny to make the baseline nearly identical to
* the vendor BSIM model; C defaults to zero (no fabricated RF coefficients).
* Do not claim signoff-quality fT/fmax/noise without S-parameter correlation.
*
* Pin order:
*   4T : D G S B
*   5T : D G S B DNW      NMOS in DNW, B = P-well
*        D G S B SUB      PMOS in DNW, B = N-well, SUB = p-substrate
*   6T : D G S B DNW PSUB NMOS in DNW with separate p-substrate
* Ported from SMIC55LL_ULP_RF (n12ll_ckt_rf_5t / dnw12ll_ckt_rf_6t /
* p12ll_ckt_rf_5t). SMIC's fitted coefficients are NOT reused.
* The DNW/PW and DNW/PSUB junctions are geometry-scaled estimates.
.subckt ics55_rf_nmos_svt_4t D G S B wf=2u l=60n nf=4
+ sa=0.24u sb=0.24u sd=0.30u mismod=0
+ rg_feed=1u rd_feed=1u rs_feed=1u rb_feed=1u
+ cgd_feed=0 cgs_feed=0 cds_feed=0
Rg G Gi {rg_feed}
Rd D Di {rd_feed}
Rs S Si {rs_feed}
Rb B Bi {rb_feed}
Xcore Di Gi Si Bi nm1p2_svt_lp w={wf*nf} l={l} nf={nf}
+ sa={sa} sb={sb} sd={sd} mismod={mismod} prelayout=0
Cgd Gi Di {cgd_feed}
Cgs Gi Si {cgs_feed}
Cds Di Si {cds_feed}
.ends ics55_rf_nmos_svt_4t

.subckt ics55_rf_pmos_svt_4t D G S B wf=2u l=60n nf=4
+ sa=0.24u sb=0.24u sd=0.30u mismod=0
+ rg_feed=1u rd_feed=1u rs_feed=1u rb_feed=1u
+ cgd_feed=0 cgs_feed=0 cds_feed=0
Rg G Gi {rg_feed}
Rd D Di {rd_feed}
Rs S Si {rs_feed}
Rb B Bi {rb_feed}
Xcore Di Gi Si Bi pm1p2_svt_lp w={wf*nf} l={l} nf={nf}
+ sa={sa} sb={sb} sd={sd} mismod={mismod} prelayout=0
Cgd Gi Di {cgd_feed}
Cgs Gi Si {cgs_feed}
Cds Di Si {cds_feed}
.ends ics55_rf_pmos_svt_4t

